# Rust build artifacts
target/

# Python env + caches
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Secrets (the embedding/generator/qdrant config lives here at runtime)
.env

# Ingested corpus — fetched PDFs are reproducible, not source; keep them out of git
# (glob the contents rather than the dir so a versioned config below can be re-included)
data/*
# ...except versioned config that IS source (loaded at startup): rag-mcp reads BOTH
# of these before it binds a port, so a clone without them cannot run the service.
# manifest.jsonl was missed here until 2026-09-03, when the deployed unit's
# WorkingDirectory moved to the clone and rag-mcp crash-looped 60 times on it.
!data/route_tree.json
!data/manifest.jsonl
